WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:06.427
76,475 Canadians have died as a result of state-administered euthanasia.

00:00:06.377 --> 00:00:16.109
This investigation examines the timeline, legislative changes, and financial data surrounding the Medical Assistance in Dying program and associated government operations.

00:00:16.109 --> 00:00:20.357
All figures presented are sourced directly from official government reports.
